  "floor_note": "floor = (write_rate/input_rate) + (N-1)*(cached_rate/input_rate). Anthropic's 1.25x write puts its floor at 1.75x, not 1.50x. Gemini reaches the same floor as OpenAI but oscillates on the way: it caches in 8,192-token blocks, so the multiplier depends on where the prefix falls relative to a boundary."
